# Daily fetch of the new-domain list (NRD) of smet.cz into the ingest
# incoming/ — deploy/nrd/README.md, docs/deploy.md §4.9.
#
# Time: 05:33 UTC. The hours below are the SERVER's LOCAL time: cron cannot
# do per-file TZ, the server zone is Europe/Moscow (UTC+3) => 08:33. When the
# server zone changes (timedatectl), recalculate the line's hours back to 05:33 UTC.
#
# Why 05:33 UTC and not the evening (the Oct 26 move, T-205): applying the
# daily NRD file (~470 k domains) landed in the evening CPU-starvation window
# (PSI ~80%) and the midnight storm of the daily recheck — the fetch now runs
# outside the starvation hours; the source day has been closed for >9 h, the
# "closed days only" contract is kept (README).
SHELL=/bin/bash
PATH=/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/sbin:/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin
33 8 * * * root /usr/local/bin/crawler-fetch-nrd
